5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We should be careful about external dependencies. I'll check the county grant terms and the endowment, and the winter road closures north of the river.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to know who can actually get to us! I'll look at the bus links in the two outer wards and attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I am concerned about the long-term funding structure. I will examine the county grant terms and the endowment, and running and equipment lines last year.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,Let's see what actually worked before. I'll check the two programmes begun six years ago and attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I worry about the staff. I'll look at the volunteer register and supervision training, and neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
