30,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The grant only covers the first year. That is a risk. Also, road closures north of the river happened eleven days last winter.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Yumi,,People in outer wards lost their bus links! They have an hour's trip now. But old outreach stops were actually very popular.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,George,,The running lines for vehicles overran by a third last year. The grant structure is indeed problematic for long-term sustainability.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,"Six years ago, digitisation failed because of indexing, but partner-run groups are still going. Outreach was a hit, as Yumi noted.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We have retired tradespeople volunteering, but no staff are trained to supervise outside facilitators. Also, our tool certification expert retired.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, if vehicle costs are overrunning, a mobile service seems risky. @Daisuke, the lack of supervision training is a serious bottleneck.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, but the people can't reach us! If the bus is gone, we have to go to them, regardless of the cost.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, we must be realistic. If the budget thins by year two, a costly vehicle service will be the first to fail.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, the partner-run groups survived because they were independent. We should look for something that doesn't rely solely on our internal staff.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, that's true, but if we need certified tools or specific supervision, we can't just ignore the roster.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The road closures prove that even if we have a vehicle, we might not reach the north side during winter.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Yumi,,But the community halls there stayed open! The people are there; they just can't get to the main library.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,George,,"I agree the need is there, but the funding shape is the problem. We need a model that doesn't collapse after twelve months.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,May,,Then we avoid the high-maintenance tech or the expensive vehicles and go for something community-led.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I just don't want the current staff to burn out trying to manage things they aren't trained for.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
